Query:
--Description: 8)  Because no 2023 hurricane/typhoon rows have BOTH latitude and longitude,
--                a spatial join is impossible.  Instead, list the states that recorded
--                the greatest number of 2023 hurricane/typhoon events (regardless of
--                coordinate availability).  This still provides a meaningful geographic
--                summary without requiring point data.
SELECT
    "state",
    COUNT(*) AS "hurricane_cnt"
FROM "NOAA_DATA_PLUS"."NOAA_HISTORIC_SEVERE_STORMS"."STORMS_2023"
WHERE "event_type" ILIKE '%hurricane%'
   OR "event_type" ILIKE '%typhoon%'
GROUP BY "state"
ORDER BY "hurricane_cnt" DESC
LIMIT 20
Answer:
state,hurricane_cnt
Gu,10
Fl,8
Ge,3
